   "source": [
    "## 第22章 识别图像中的文本"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a8bf83ef",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- 准备环境：\n",
    "    - 安装Tesseract：是一个开源的OCR工具，可以识别图像中的文字。**注意：需要安装相应的识别文字语言包。**\n",
    "    - 安装pytesseract：`pip install pytesseract`。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "841231a1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- 识别步骤：\n",
    "    - 打开图片：`img = PIL.Image.open()`。\n",
    "    - 识别文字：`text = pytesseract.image_to_string(img)`。"
   ]
  }
 ],
